              "message": "README: the concepts before the identifiers, plainer text, and the code behind a click\n\nThe README says what CHAP is made of before it uses its terms: the\ncoordinator, the workspace, participants, tasks, artefacts, envelopes and\nthe audit log, the verbs, and Core with its profiles. The opening states\nthe problem plainly: work in which many agents and many people take part,\nand the human decisions that make it accountable. Install offers the\nlibraries, a new project with create-chap-app, and the example from a\nclone, each in a block GitHub can copy. The tour's code and the citation\nopen on a click; the images, the links and the example code are as\nbefore.",
              "files": [
                {
